\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Clickable \textbf {Run on Colab} button, available at the beginning of the \textbf {Theoretical} and \textbf {Practical} parts of each chapter, allowing interactive execution of the examples and exercises. In the PDF version, there is a direct HTML \emph {link} between the simulator image and its caption.}}{4}{figure.caption.6}%
