\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8.7}{\ignorespaces Interactive simulator of RANSAC applied to image registration: key points from two images are matched by a descriptor, some correspondences are spurious (\emph {outliers}), and RANSAC estimates the similarity transformation that aligns most of them.}}{433}{figure.caption.287}%
